{% comment %}
  Therapy flow — post-request success screen (node 539:2222), shown after
  "Submit Request" is tapped on Therapy Details (Step 2 of 2). Analogous
  to the consultation flow's Booking Confirmed screen, but simpler and
  genuinely different content, not a restyle of it:
  - No appointment/doctor card here — the export doesn't have one.
  - Heading is "Request sent" (not "Appointment confirmed").
  - Details card is titled "Consultation Details" (kept exactly as the
    export has it, even in the therapy flow) and its rows are Reference
    No. / Patient Name / Therapy / Payment — no Mode or Date & Time (the
    therapy flow never collects a slot).
  - Two action buttons below the card, "Shop Products" and
    "Get directions" — new UI not present on any other step.
  - Header is just a close button, right-aligned — no back button, no
    facility badge, no progress bar (matches the export; also matches
    Booking Confirmed's own "nothing to go back to" reasoning).

  Reuses the shared .kal-confirmation-success-icon/__inner (green
  checkmark badge) and .kal-confirmation-details__* classes from Booking
  Confirmed's screen — those are already generic, not step-scoped.

  Reference No. and Payment ("At the Clinic") are static/decorative, same
  "visual match, not wired" treatment used elsewhere in this flow — no
  backend call produces a real reference number, and there's no Payment
  Method step in the therapy flow to reflect. Patient Name reuses the
  EXACT SAME data-kal-confirm-name hook the consultation flow's
  Confirmation/Booking Confirmed screens use (same shared patientDetails
  state — see kal-booking-flow.js), so it needs no new JS to populate
  correctly. "Therapy" (data-kal-therapy-confirm-summary) is new — set by
  renderTherapyConfirmedSummary() in kal-booking-flow.js, which joins
  whichever category checkboxes and/or dropdown therapies were selected
  on Step 1 of 2 into one display string.

  "Shop Products"/"Get directions" have no click handlers — decorative
  per this build's scope, same as several other action-shaped buttons
  elsewhere in this flow before their real destinations existed.
{% endcomment %}

<div class="kal-step-therapy-confirmed kal-step-shell">

  <div class="kal-step-entry__info kal-step-shell__info">
    <div class="kal-step-entry__info-content">
      <h2 class="kal-step-entry__heading">Request sent</h2>
      <p class="kal-step-entry__body-text">A confirmation is sent to your WhatsApp number.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="kal-step-entry__location">
      <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--location">
        <!-- ICON: location-pin (not received yet) -->
      </span>
      <span class="kal-step-entry__location-text">
        Kerala Ayurveda Wellness Center, Indiranagar &middot; Opens 8 AM
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="kal-step-shell__panel">

    <div class="kal-step-therapy-confirmed__header">
      <button type="button" class="kal-step-doctor-select__back" data-kal-close aria-label="Close">
        {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'close' -%}
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="kal-step-shell__scroll">
      <div class="kal-confirmation-success-icon">
        <span class="kal-confirmation-success-icon__inner">
          {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'check' -%}
        </span>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-step-therapy-confirmed__intro">
        <h2 class="kal-step-doctor-select__heading">Request sent</h2>
        <p class="kal-step-doctor-select__subtext">A confirmation is sent to your WhatsApp number.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-confirmation-details">
        <p class="kal-confirmation-details__label">Consultation Details</p>
        <div class="kal-confirmation-details__divider"></div>
        <div class="kal-confirmation-details__rows">
          <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
            <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Reference No.</span>
            <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value">REF-4217</span>
          </div>
          <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
            <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Patient Name</span>
            <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-confirm-name>&mdash;</span>
          </div>
          <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
            <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Therapy</span>
            <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value" data-kal-therapy-confirm-summary>&mdash;</span>
          </div>
          <div class="kal-confirmation-details__row">
            <span class="kal-confirmation-details__key">Payment</span>
            <span class="kal-confirmation-details__value">At the Clinic</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="kal-therapy-confirmed-actions">
        <button type="button" class="kal-therapy-confirmed-actions__btn">
          <span class="kal-therapy-confirmed-actions__icon">
            {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'shopping-cart' -%}
          </span>
          <span>Shop Products</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="kal-therapy-confirmed-actions__btn">
          <span class="kal-therapy-confirmed-actions__icon">
            {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'location-pin' -%}
          </span>
          <span>Get directions</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>
